The value "yes" would reload as a boolean under YAML 1.1, so the emitter writes it single-quoted to preserve it as a string.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md summary=yes
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
+summary: 'yes'
 ---
 # Body
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
summary: 'yes'
---
# Body
